1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:02,060
I never learned what happened to Yeagher.

2
00:00:03,030 --> 00:00:04,240
Lambert had him picked up.

3
00:00:04,660 --> 00:00:05,660
He's still in custody.

4
00:00:05,770 --> 00:00:07,900
Dufraisne looked for him,
but not too hard.

5
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:09,660
But let's get back to you.

6
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:14,200
Your first assignment for the JBA
was to rob a train in New York?

7
00:00:15,230 --> 00:00:19,600
A private train used by a bank to transfer
liquid assets without drawing attention.

8
00:00:20,690 --> 00:00:22,080
Did you know what the money was for?

9
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:24,950
No, but Emile didn't want any witnesses.

10
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:27,720
He ordered me
to kill anyone I came across.

11
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:30,010
Lambert told me the exact opposite.

12
00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:31,420
Zero casualties.

13
00:00:32,130 --> 00:00:33,900
Who supplied your equipment
for this robbery?

14
00:00:34,470 --> 00:00:36,230
Lambert was posing as an arms dealer.

15
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:40,300
He sold equipment to Dufraisne so I could
still have access to my usual gear.

16
00:00:41,010 --> 00:00:42,720
That was a big risk.

17
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:44,380
Too big.
